<section class="about-preview">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Me</p>

      <h2>
        I build software to solve practical problems.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>
        I'm a software developer interested in building useful applications
        and understanding how technology works from the frontend to the
        backend.
      </p>

      <p>
        I enjoy working with modern web technologies, designing APIs,
        connecting applications to databases, and turning ideas into
        working software.
      </p>

      <a href="/about" class="about-link">
        More about me →
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-preview {
    padding: 8rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;

    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>